 "remarks": "Welcome to The Buckingham, where spacious living meets downtown convenience! This rarely available 7th floor, 1 bedroom, 1-bath residence offers an exceptional opportunity to enjoy comfortable, low-maintenance living in the heart of Stamford. Beautiful wood flooring, custom millwork and generous living spaces create an inviting atmosphere, while large windows bring in abundant natural light. The thoughtfully designed layout offers plenty of flexibility for everyday living, entertaining or working from home. Step outside onto your private balcony to enjoy fresh air and elevated views of the city. Additional conveniences include ample storage and one garage parking space. The Buckingham offers an impressive array of amenities, including doorman service, 24-hour security, a clubroom with fireplace and kitchen, fitness room, conference room and outdoor pool. Ideally situated just moments from Stamford's vibrant dining, shopping, entertainment and transportation options, this is a fantastic opportunity to enjoy the best of downtown living!",
